<title>FRANCE: Apple, France Telecom in pact.</title>
<headline>Apple, France Telecom in pact.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom said it had signed a deal with Apple Computer Inc for a partnership in co-marketing and co-development of products for Internet, videoconferencing and mobile telephones.</p>
<p>In a statement the companies said that they would develop products which combine computer technology with telecommunications.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
